  "title": "Bánh Mì",
  "description": "Love bánh mì? Try this version of the popular Vietnamese sandwich featuring tender chicken and tangy quick-pickled veggies in a crunchy baguette.",
  "authors": [
    "metzstar"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:38:58-04:00",
